      "quote": "Um be safe\nYeah, it’s fine at all but if you check what data is linked to you, your location is linked to you and you don’t think that’s kind of creepy right"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R292]",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "A parent reports that avatar items purchased with Robux sometimes disappear, leaving them with less Robux than expected.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Love Roblox but I am really angry that when you buy clothes or stuff for your avatar with your robux, some times things in the inventory will disappear and sometimes they will give Robux back, but they won’t give it all back so I can’t get any other emotes because they’re all 300 robux and it only gave me back 200"
    }
